[00:10.80]Fighting flames of fire
{"与烈焰搏斗"}
[00:13.38]Hang onto burning wires
{"紧握燃烧的电线"}
[00:16.02]We don't care anymore
{"我们已不再在乎"}
[00:21.40]Are we fading lovers?
{"我们是渐逝的爱侣吗？"}
[00:23.92]We keep wasting colors
{"我们不断挥霍色彩"}
[00:26.66]Maybe we should let this go
{"或许我们该放手了"}
